    "context": "Use this subset of the time vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U4-05. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to reconcile a schedule conflict and explain the resulting order of events.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U4-05-P01-speak-produce",
